# German translation of the GenHa user interface.
#
# Keys (msgid) are the English strings in the code; a missing or empty msgstr shows in English.
# Style: neutral and concise, no "du"/"Sie" (infinitives and nouns: "Bild hochladen",
# "Hintergrund entfernen"; one exception by the owner's wish: the home screen's headline "Womit
# möchtest du anfangen?"). Placeholders such as {n} or {path} stay as they are; a trailing space
# in the English (field prefixes such as "Size ") is kept. Section labels in capitals stay in
# capitals. Checks: `cargo test -p genha-i18n` (well-formed) and `cargo test -p genha-ui-egui
# every_ui_string` (complete, nothing unused).
#
# This file is part of GenHa and is licensed MIT OR Apache-2.0.
